nt,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">小米发布具身智能基底模型Xiaomi-Robotics-1，探索物理AI规模化路径</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">前OpenAI CTO穆拉蒂创立思维机器实验室，发布多模态开源模型Inkling</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">MiniMax Code 2.0桌面端正式发布，本月将上线远程操控与浏览器接管功能</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里通义千问正式接入苹果生态，全面集成至中国区Apple智能功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d1a48292d65fb5bbe0b78183b1b15486.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里巴巴自研大模型“通义千问”已正式接入苹果生态，将全面集成至中国区Apple智能（Apple Intelligence）功能中。此次集成覆盖iOS、iPadOS、macOS及visionOS四大操作系统，国内苹果用户未来可在系统层面直接调用通义千问的图文深度理解与高质量生成能力，无需频繁切换App。此前，苹果技术开发（上海）有限公司的“Apple智能”大模型已通过网信办备案。除阿里外，百度也作为合作伙伴参与其中，负责AI搜索功能开发及中国版Siri的智能化升级。此次合作标志着国产顶尖AI技术加速在国际顶级消费电子生态中落地，通过与本土大模型厂商深度协作，苹果正致力于为中国用户提供更流畅、本土化的智能体验，显著简化了用户的操作路径。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌升级Gemini Spark AI助手，新增Workspace编辑能力并提速50%以上</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8c5574c883415011ed11df2ffc9ec05d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式升级Gemini Spark AI助手，重点增强其与Google Workspace的深度集成，并显著提升AI代理运行效率。此次更新后，Gemini Spark不仅能打开和编辑Google文档，还支持读取及编辑Google表格与幻灯片中的评论，覆盖共享及私有文件，进一步强化了其在办公场景下的任务执行能力。性能方面，Gemini Spark的AI代理处理速度提升超过50%，并支持并行处理多数据源信息，以应对复杂办公任务。目前，该功能已向支持地区的Google AI Ultra订阅用户开放，但欧洲经济区、尼日利亚、瑞士和英国暂不在支持范围内。谷歌副总裁Josh Woodward透露，未来AI Pro用户也有望获得访问权限。此次升级标志着Gemini Spark正从单一的内容生成工具，向具备深度办公自动化能力</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">小米发布具身智能基底模型Xiaomi-Robotics-1，探索物理AI规模化路径</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/fd3f0e62f86556152f0cc36bd70f6e44.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">小米正式发布面向真实移动操作任务的具身基底模型Xiaomi-Robotics-1，旨在探索物理AI的Scaling Law效应。该模型在预训练阶段利用UMI设备采集了10万小时真实世界轨迹，覆盖家庭、商业及工业场景，并结合视觉语言模型在两周内完成自动标注。在后训练阶段，通过1万小时跨本体数据实现指令对齐，使模型具备多类移动操作能力。Xiaomi-Robotics-1提供2B、5B、10B三种参数版本，实验显示其动作预测精度与任务成功率随模型尺寸提升呈现显著增长，并在RoboCasa365、RoboDojo等仿真基准上刷新SOTA纪录。该成果验证了“大规模预训练-跨本体后训练-少量数据微调”的可规模化训练路径，为具身智能从实验室走向复杂物理世界提供了关键技术范式。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">前OpenAI CTO穆拉蒂创立思维机器实验室，发布多模态开源模型Inkling</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/7047440a761b1b93640b3a9e998349ee.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">前OpenAI CTO米拉·穆拉蒂创立的思维机器实验室正式推出多模态AI模型Inkling，并已开放权重。该模型采用混合专家架构，总参数量975B，激活参数41B，支持100万tokens上下文，预训练数据达45万亿tokens，覆盖文本、图像、音频及视频模态。在性能表现上，Inkling在AIME2026数学测试中以97.1%得分领先DeepSeek，视觉基准MMMU Pro得分73.3%，音频处理MMAU得分77.2%。尽管在多模态领域表现亮眼，且在推理、编码及智能体工作流方面优于英伟达Nemotron 3 Ultra，但Inkling在编程与复杂推理任务上仍落后于GLM 5.2、DeepSeek V4 Pro等中国开源模型，且与Claude Fable 5、GPT-5.6 Sol等闭源巨头在极限推理及软件</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">MiniMax Code 2.0桌面端正式发布，本月将上线远程操控与浏览器接管功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3ab5fee05d3a5c9c09aa9954906e4498.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">7月16日，MiniMax Code 2.0桌面端正式开放下载，重点优化了长链路编码任务中的上下文衔接与稳定性，旨在解决代理在执行长任务时易出现的中断、卡顿及上下文丢失问题，确保自动化流程能完整执行。此次更新通过底层架构优化，显著降低了长任务的返工成本。此外，MiniMax预告本月内将陆续上线远程控制、浏览器操控、目标模式及计划模式等核心功能。其中，浏览器操控将赋予代理网页交互能力，而目标与计划模式则强化了复杂任务的拆解与编排能力。这一系列更新标志着MiniMax Code正从单一的代码生成工具，向具备跨环境协同、独立处理复杂任务能力的Agent演进，为开发者提供更高效的自动化编码工作流。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
